  "discription": {
    "note": "Fast-growing oak with large pointed-lobed leaves and red to orange-brown autumn colour. Dense shade and slow-decomposing litter suppress forest floor vegetation; considered invasive in Flemish woodlands. Avoid near natural forest.",
